{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43408","headline":"小苏家 · 无名氏","name":"小苏家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双月讴䛩辗秋碧，细风斜掩神仙宅。\n麦门冬长马鬣青，茱萸蘂绽蝇头赤。\n流苏斗帐悬高壁，彩凤盘龙缴香额。\n堂内月娥横剪波，倚门肠断鰕须隔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}